00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:17,750
So imagine people with a torch, you know, going into a cave or, you know, like in into the forest and basically discovering data that they didn't know about or dashboard that they don't know about that they don't even work.

176
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:25,510
Cuz we're seeing customers having dashboards that don't work in their legacy vendor and they don't know it's not working.

